---
title: Project detail · display states
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Stopped
  Stopped --> Starting : Start
  Starting --> Running : all services up
  Starting --> FailedStart : a service exited
  Running --> Degraded : a service down
  Degraded --> Running : service back
  Running --> Stopping : Stop
  Degraded --> Stopping : Stop
  Stopping --> Stopped : down done
  FailedStart --> Starting : Retry
  FailedStart --> Stopped : Stop
  FailedStart --> NeedsAttention : always-on 3x
  NeedsAttention --> Starting : Retry
  note right of NeedsAttention
    INV the app never retries
    by itself
  end note
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-dasharray:2 2
  classDef fail stroke-width:2px
  class Running live
  class Starting,Stopping wait
  class FailedStart,NeedsAttention,Degraded fail
